(6. Incident reporting) Tj T*
(Any suspected or actual security incident must be reported to the security team within one) Tj T*
(hour of) Tj T*
(discovery, by email to security@northwind.example or by calling the 24-hour security) Tj T*
(hotline.) Tj T*
(Reportable events include lost or stolen devices, suspected phishing, accidental disclosure) Tj T*
(of) Tj T*
(data, malware alerts and unauthorised access. Staff must not attempt to investigate or) Tj T*
(remediate an) Tj T*
(incident themselves, and must preserve evidence, including keeping the affected device) Tj T*
(powered on) Tj T*
(and connected. The security team acknowledges every report within two hours and assigns a) Tj T*
(severity) Tj T*
(within four hours. Incidents rated severity 1 are escalated to the executive team) Tj T*
(immediately and) Tj T*
(regulators are notified within 72 hours where personal data is involved.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Third parties and suppliers) Tj T*
(Suppliers who process company data must complete a security assessment before contract) Tj T*
(signature) Tj T*
(and must be re-assessed annually. Contracts must include breach notification within 24) Tj T*
(hours, a) Tj T*
(right to audit, and defined data deletion obligations at the end of the engagement. Third-) Tj T*
(party) Tj T*
(access is time-limited and granted through the supplier portal, never by sharing staff) Tj T*
(credentials.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Data retention and disposal) Tj T*
(Business records are retained for seven years unless a longer statutory period applies.) Tj T*
(Personal) Tj T*
(data is retained only as long as needed for the purpose it was collected for, as recorded in) Tj T*
(the) Tj T*
(processing register. Electronic media is wiped to the current NIST purge standard before) Tj T*
(disposal,) Tj T*
(and paper records containing Confidential or Restricted information are cross-cut shredded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Business continuity) Tj T*
(Critical systems are backed up daily, with backups replicated to a second region and tested) Tj T*
(by) Tj T*
(restore at least twice a year. The recovery time objective for critical systems is four) Tj T*
(hours and) Tj T*
(the recovery point objective is one hour.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. Compliance and exceptions) Tj T*
